<td id="S6.T6.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">HLE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Phan et al., 2025</a>)</cite></td>
<td id="S6.T6.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S6.T6.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">partial</span></td>
