<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span><span id="A1.T8.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Intermediate step accuracy and error propagation.</span> Per-step F1 (%) on 40 <span id="A1.T8.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">DeepSynth</span> tasks. <span id="A1.T8.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Prop.</span> denotes error propagation rate: the percentage of cases where failure at step <math id="A1.T8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> (F1 <math id="A1.T8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;50</annotation></semantics></math>) also results in failure at step <math id="A1.T8.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{+}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{+}1</annotation></semantics></math>. Steps with <math id="A1.T8.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n&lt;3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n&lt;3</annotation></semantics></math> are omitted. GPT-4.1 and DeepSeek-R1 operate without web access; GPT-5.2 operates with web search enabled. All models show steep accuracy decay and near-total error propagation.</figcaption>
</figure>
